:: MP World Event Loose Cobble [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<generate1>><<person1>>
你走在街边的石板路上时，脚尖忽然踢到了一块微微翘起的青石板。石板下方似乎露出了一角用油布包裹的硬物。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[蹲下身撬开松动的青石板 (0:10)|MP World Event Loose Cobble A]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[假装系鞋带顺手摸走油布包 (0:10)|MP World Event Loose Cobble B]]>><<pass 10>><<skulduggery 2>><</link>><<gskulduggery>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[环顾四周后用脚将石板踩回原位 (0:05)|MP World Event Loose Cobble C]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble A [nobr]
<<effects>>
你挪开青石板，发现底下藏着一只精巧的黄铜鼻烟盒，盒盖内侧还刻着旧贵族的家徽。或许高街的旧货铺或博物馆认得它的来历。
<<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 25>>
<<if 1 gt 0>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[顺着附近的痕迹继续探查 (0:15)|MP World Deep Explore Domus_Street 0]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "Domus Street")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

